GeoNames
--------

The location parser (backend/app/ingest/normalize.py) and the location evaluation (evals/location/) read place names
from the GeoNames geographical database, https://www.geonames.org, through the geonamescache package.

The GeoNames data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. This work uses the cities of 15,000 inhabitants or more (names, alternate
names, country, region code, population) as geonamescache 3.0.2 ships them. The data is not altered; names are compared
without case, accents or punctuation.

